From: junkyard
Subject: [PATCH] power/mitigation: port to Linux 6.18 (lynx)

Port private/google-modules/power/mitigation to the GrapheneOS Linux 6.18 GKI for the gs201 lynx build.
Mechanical API migrations, no intended behaviour change:

  - relax -Wmissing-prototypes (on by default since 6.8, fatal with CONFIG_WERROR) for this vendor code

Files: BUILD.bazel, soc/gs/gs_bcl_qos.c

lynx-only (kernel/patches-lynx/): felix builds the 6.1 tree these
drivers were written for.
---
diff --git a/BUILD.bazel b/BUILD.bazel
index b320c37..4806405 100644
--- a/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/BUILD.bazel
@@ -54,6 +54,8 @@ ddk_module(
         "ifpmic/max777x9.c",
         "soc/userspace/userspace_bcl_qos.c",
     ],
+    # junkyard (lynx, 6.18): vendor code predating default -Wmissing-prototypes (6.8)
+    copts = ["-Wno-error=missing-prototypes"],
     out = "google_bcl.ko",
     conditional_srcs = {
         "CONFIG_SOC_RDO": {
diff --git a/soc/gs/gs_bcl_qos.c b/soc/gs/gs_bcl_qos.c
index c31ab7b..d78efda 100644
--- a/soc/gs/gs_bcl_qos.c
+++ b/soc/gs/gs_bcl_qos.c
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
  *
  */
 
+#include "../soc_defs.h"	/* declares the google_bcl_*_qos() it defines */
 #include <linux/of.h>
 #include <linux/cpu.h>
 #include <linux/cpufreq.h>
